{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Shattered Heart, A Supernatural Guide:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can You Rise From Betrayal to Become the Alpha You Were Meant to Be?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585000/extras/192a91bde94cd9d24ad8dd1f2fede783.avif?t=1761840015\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585000/extras_big/192a91bde94cd9d24ad8dd1f2fede783.webp?t=1761840015 width=1560 height=780 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story follows a heartbroken college student whose world crumbles when his girlfriend Jane cheats on him with the campus quarterback. Dylan, once confident and ambitious, finds himself isolated and humiliated as malicious rumors destroy his reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585000/extras/6a459576b5be6a41b2cfab876533e633.poster.avif?t=1761840015\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585000/extras/6a459576b5be6a41b2cfab876533e633.webm?t=1761840015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just when despair threatens to consume him completely, a mysterious voice from his damaged phone offers an unlikely alliance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Bull Phone, a supernatural entity with its own agenda, promises to transform our protagonist from victim to victor. But this power comes with a price - he must prove himself worthy through a series of increasingly bold encounters...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2605 Branching Consequences \u2605</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice shapes your transformation across 6 compelling episodes. Build genuine connections or pursue pure conquest - your decisions determine which of multiple endings you'll achieve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585000/extras/7457ba2986cc5335f9258b9b49efdb46.poster.avif?t=1761840015\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585000/extras/7457ba2986cc5335f9258b9b49efdb46.webm?t=1761840015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585000/extras/7457ba2986cc5335f9258b9b49efdb46.mp4?t=1761840015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>\u2605 Complex Characters \u2605</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with a diverse cast of women, each with their own motivations, desires, and backstories. From college students to professional women, each relationship offers unique challenges and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585000/extras/782a65a705cdf47f62b1e7f2a3a549d4.avif?t=1761840015\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2605 Stunning Visuals \u2605</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience over 24 meticulously crafted intimate scenes with fluid frame-by-frame animation. Each encounter is brought to life through detailed artwork that captures both passion and emotion.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3585000/be05323be9bd0692126fabefb39caff3832b78fe.jpg"},{"name":"Charmer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3585000/e5875d3db04fc70cb07cf1f1205a3713e9aa2f2a.jpg"},{"name